WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:22.490
Ngaphakathi esibelethweni, umntwana ongakazalwa uzungezwe imisindo epholile nepholile, kuhlanganise neyakhe

2
00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:31.870
ukushaya kwenhliziyo kamama nohlelo lokugaya ukudla kanye namazwi nemisindo evela emhlabeni ngaphandle. Njengoba

3
00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:38.750
ukukhulelwa kufinyelela esigabeni sokugcina, amehlo omntwana angavuleka ngaphakathi esibelethweni. Nakuba bengakwazi

4
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:46.950
kodwa babone izithombe noma imininingwane, bangezwa izinguquko ekukhanyeni. Ngakho, kuyilapho ukuphila esibelethweni kuyinto muffled

5
00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:56.840
futhi kufiphele, kukude nokuthula. Ukuzalwa kuwushintsho olukhulu enganeni. Bangena ngokuphazima kweso

6
00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:03.820
umhlaba ogcwele izinto ezintsha, ezigqamile nemisindo ephezulu. Ukuzivumelanisa naleli zwe elisha kuyinzwa

7
00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:10.340
ukuvuka lokho kukhahlela-kuqala ukukhula kwabo. Emasontweni ambalwa okuqala okuphila, ingane izokwenza

8
00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:17.200
athuke avuke uma kunemisindo ephezulu. Amehlo abo azwela ukukhanya okukhanyayo,

9
00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:25.330
kodwa basabona okuncane kakhulu. Umbono wabo, nokho, uqala ukukhula ngendlela emangalisayo

10
00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:33.240
isilinganiso. Phakathi namasonto amabili, umbono usuthuthuke kakhulu. Manje sebengabona imininingwane ethile, ikakhulukazi

11
00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:39.780
uma izinto ziseduze. Awukho umbala, futhi abakubonayo kuyisicaba ngenxa yamehlo abo

12
00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:45.880
azikahlale ziqondile futhi zisebenza ndawonye ukuze uthole ukuqonda okujulile. Kwesinye isikhathi amehlo abo

13
00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:52.730
izokhukhuleka ingene noma iphume isikhashana. Lokhu kubizwa ngokuthi ukuklolodela. Lokhu kufanele kuyeke ukwenzeka

14
00:01:52.730 --> 00:02:00.340
ngezinyanga ezintathu. Ngenyanga eyodwa, ukubona imibala kuqala ukukhula. Bazoba baningi

15
00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:06.160
nentshisekelo ebonakalayo, ikakhulukazi ebusweni. Bazoqala futhi ukuzama ukulandela izinto

16
00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:13.030
ezihambayo. Bazokwazi ngokwengeziwe imisindo ejwayelekile, kuhlanganise neyaziwa kakhulu

17
00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:19.450
amazwi, njengomndeni wabo, futhi baqale ukuhlanganisa abakuzwayo nabakuzwayo

18
00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:24.820
bona. Ezinyangeni ezintathu, amehlo azo kufanele ahlale eqondile futhi asebenze ndawonye ukudala

19
00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:31.620
Umbono we-3D. Lo mbono omusha ojulile ubasiza ukuba bafinyelele izinto ngokunembe kakhudlwana. Bona

20
00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:37.240
uzokwazi ukulandela izinto ezihamba ngokushesha. Ngesikhathi esifanayo, imisindo enengqondo

21
00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:45.420
izoqala ukwenziwa. Ezinyangeni eziyisithupha, umntwana kufanele akwazi ukubona abantu abajwayele

22
00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:50.960
kokubili ubuso namazwi abo. Bangakwazi futhi ukubona izinto ezikude

23
00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:57.880
kude. Beqhutshwa ilukuluku lokufuna ukwazi, bazofinyelela izinto, bakhase ngakuzo, futhi, bazungeze

24
00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:03.760
usuku lwabo lokuzalwa lokuqala, ukuhamba ngezinyawo. Ukubhibhidla kwabo kuyakhula futhi imisindo izoba eyokuqala

25
00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:13.460
amagama kulesi sigaba futhi. Ezinyangeni ezingu-18, umbono usufana nomuntu omdala, nakuba usamile

26
00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:20.520
ukufiphala kancane. Manje bazokwazi ukubona igama labo futhi basebenzise amagama amaningi.

27
00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:28.300
Ezinye izingane zingase zingafinyeleli lezi zenzakalo ezibalulekile ngesikhathi esilindelekile. Akhona

28
00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:34.210
izizathu eziningi zalokhu, futhi abaningi bazozilungisa. Ngokwesibonelo, izingane ezizalwa ngaphambi kwesikhathi

29
00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:40.920
ingase ibe nokubambezeleka, kodwa ngokuvamile itholakala kamuva ebuntwaneni. Kwabanye, kungase kube nokuphikelela

30
00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:47.710
ubunzima. Ukuhlonza lezi ngokushesha ngangokunokwenzeka ukuze unikeze ukwelashwa nokusekelwa kungakwazi

31
00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:49.210
ukwandisa intuthuko.
